{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-05_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-05","title":"確認交戰視界","storyCode":"14-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"92bc34ddb074576c2641ff17adcb48320aa5b9fbc7e8d7027bfbf725bd13657c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，明椒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你們不要亂跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們逃跑吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛注意到了，那個W的雇傭兵全都跑出去了，應該是軍事委員會的人已經打過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們更應該藏好，別被飛來飛去的炮彈打到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，我們可是軍事委員會雇來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經打過來了，這裡的人遲早玩完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就是我們逃命的好機會。等我們見到曼弗雷德將軍，一定能解釋清楚的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們打算回到他那裡去……你們還要繼續留在維多利亞殺人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪管得了那麼多！要是被將軍發現我們投降了，就更沒有活路了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能活下來，他們讓我去運貨我就運貨，讓我去殺人我就殺人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你要留在這就隨你吧！我要走了！再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"行動開始後五十小時"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的運氣真的很好，厄爾蘇拉軍令長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弄丟了至關重要的戰爭裝備，被叛軍俘虜後，還能全鬚全尾地回來的情況並不常見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同為疤痕商場的傭兵，你和他們處得很好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴小食腐者，還輪不到你來評判我的失敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，厄爾蘇拉軍令長的存活對於軍事委員會來說都是一個好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德將軍，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君的殞沒我已知曉，解釋的話可以之後再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我希望你出現在這裡，是帶著有價值的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶回了骸骨的位置……還有留守骸骨的傭兵的具體情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這？聽上去你留在那些雇傭兵手裡還更有價值一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想聽聽你的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨獸骸骨無法啟動，那群傭兵正在想方設法讓它重啟。他們接下來的打算，應該也離不開那個東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚這伙雇傭兵的具體計劃，但是不知為什麼，他們留守骸骨的人似乎並不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，也在其中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳令，包圍這片峽谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不惜一切代價，立刻奪回脊椎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德將軍，接下來的戰鬥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用參與，留在後方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍……以防萬一，我還是想請示一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果敵人抵抗激烈，我們遲遲奪不下骸骨，又該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡聽到這種假設，厄爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德的軍隊還是到了，比預想的要快一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王庭軍的消息呢？厄爾蘇拉還是什麼都沒有交代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她逃走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我疏忽了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以回過頭再算這筆帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去外面調查戰場動向了，最壞的情況，她會比我們先遭遇敵軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果厄爾蘇拉回到了曼弗雷德那裡，我們現在的位置，還有布防情況可能已經全部暴露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們和敵軍的戰力差距過於懸殊，打持久戰我們沒有勝算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他們出發已經有五十個小時了，有任何通訊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，我們要堅守到約定的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以我們的人手，想擋住軍事委員會的大軍一整天，只能期待一場天災砸在曼弗雷德頭上，可天災現在還會聽他們的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會不可能允許這樣一個可以威脅他們制空權的武器落在我們手裡，他們一定會不惜一切代價幹掉我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只能賭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賭曼弗雷德，也並不想毀掉這具骸骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但願你真的和你想的一樣了解曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個問題，如果到了時間，博士那邊還沒有聯絡怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就放棄骸骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死戰沒有意義，優先撤離人員，不論什麼時候，留下更多活著的人才是我們最根本的第一要務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合理的判斷，我沒有異議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有另外一個，或許可以拖緩王庭軍進攻的辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接了結對方指揮官的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會殺了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g6_sarkazancientruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，爛木頭。聽著，我沒有時間和你耗著。我只有幾個問題，你的回答決定了我的炸彈會不會扔到你的臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是赦罪師的祭壇，你是赦罪師？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐺——鐺——\n斧頭的敲鑿聲沒有停下，保持著它懾人的節奏，彷彿亙古以來就是如此。\n怪人緩緩開口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我乃，魔王奎薩圖什塔的僕從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王的血脈在生死中延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若赦罪師為侍奉魔王之人，那我亦為，赦罪師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繞來繞去……原來你會說人話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我開炮前，還可以給你點時間自我介紹一下。還有這到底是什麼地方？和赦罪師是什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Qa……lid'čoa……喀利喀……“鑰匙”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這把鑰匙已不再有可打開的門。如今，我不過是這幽深墓穴的……守墓人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在說什麼……墓穴？誰的墓穴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾曾經的無數英雄，還有葬送在他們手中的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“負碑者”“八英傑”“十一勇士”……他們在歷史中一一隕落，不少人由我親自送別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡埋藏的是他們的武器與甲胄，是往日的餘燼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑，你和這些人都打過交道，該不會是和老女人一輩的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些老怪物真無聊，這麼喜歡抱著過去的東西不放，忘了昨晚吃了什麼今天就不會走路了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些從英雄時代中一躍而出的人，一次又一次地被視作拯救薩卡茲的希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們都失敗了，變成了這墓穴中的一抔塵土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你腳下的，就是魔王奎隆的佩劍，名為青色怒火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯拒絕佩戴此劍，而將它留在此地。即便如此，你也不該將它踩在腳下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎隆？他不是神話裡才有的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是在糊弄我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的問題，我已經回答。該你回答，我的疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何要闖入此地？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐺——\n又一斧落下，湧來的氣浪差點讓W又退了一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來找赦罪師的麻煩，這裡的祭壇是幹什麼用的，最好老實交代！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祭壇的使命已然結束，除了誤入當中的愚者，不會再有人來造訪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我在問你話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攻擊徒勞，這具身體，不會再有變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失敗的容器，不得作為迎接王冠的器具永生，也不得死亡以獲安息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你也是赦罪師實驗的殘次品囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是覺得自己很可憐嗎？我可以幫你解脫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何必，徒勞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪人揚起石斧，像是驅趕惱人的蠅蟲，揮開了W擲過去的炸彈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說你是赦罪師造出來的不壞之軀？我倒要看看這個距離能不能把你的腦袋炸開花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師好像總喜歡做些實驗，那些大頭蛾子也是你們捏出來的玩意？這個專門生產怪物的老巢還真是噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收起你那些聽不懂的唱詩，我問什麼你就答什麼——你知道特蕾西婭嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流放之人，有幸見過那位魔王……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，就是那位悲傷的魔王，重生之處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是在這……他們……是怎麼做到的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師帶回了魔王染血的軀體，將她的魂魄從眾魂中裁剪出來，但她與眾魂的臍帶已緊密連接。她已經無法作為自己而存在。"},{"type":"narration","text":"W回頭看向了山洞中央的那座祭壇。\n造型猙獰的建築散發出令人不安的氣息，隱隱有污濁刺鼻的血腥味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的當下，需要她死去；薩卡茲的未來，需要她活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她作為魔王，決意獻出自己的一切，靈與識，血與骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傭兵，你為魔王的舊部，追隨魔王而來。可她已不是你所識之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到，她在這裡被喚醒，她面容悲傷；我看到，她所負靈魂之重，她的靈魂永遠不得平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了……住口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她是祭品，獻於眾魂，獻於卡茲戴爾，獻於過去與未來所有薩卡茲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g6_sarkazancientruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"煙塵滾滾，填滿了整座洞穴。爆炸尚不足以宣洩憤怒，腐舊的陳設在此刻已變為一地廢墟。\n在山洞深處，還剩下一座祭壇，形似門扉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空靈的呢喃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個……是什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空靈的呢喃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"W推開了那扇門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
